					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the pam_pwquality.so module is present in the "/etc/pam.d/password-auth" file:

$ sudo grep pam_pwquality /etc/pam.d/password-auth
