					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the cryptographic hashes of system files match vendor values.

The System Administrator will review the output of the package verification command with the Information System Security Officer (ISSO) and document any expected deviations, such as locally approved configuration file changes.

If deviations are present and have not been documented and approved by the ISSO, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The System Administrator will investigate each reported deviation and, with ISSO approval, either restore the vendor file or document the deviation as an accepted local change.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
