				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configuration management is the process of controlling changes to a system throughout its lifecycle.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
