				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Physical access controls are a prerequisite to every logical control the operating system implements.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
