					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Relocate the system to a controlled access area meeting the physical security requirements for its classification level, or obtain a documented risk acceptance from the Authorizing Official.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
