				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_Title</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>RHEL 8 users must be trained on the acceptable use policy before being granted access.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Organizations are required to ensure users are aware of their responsibilities before granting access.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
