					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify all users with accounts on the system have completed acceptable use training.

Ask the System Administrator for training records. The Information System Security Officer (ISSO) will verify records exist for every interactive account on the system.

If training records are missing for any account, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
