					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Ensure every user completes acceptable use training before an account is created, and retain the training records for the life of the account.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
